maid_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"cocoa","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_20","text":"we gotta set a good example.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_21","text":"Hear that, @Mast?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_22","text":"@Drake","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_23","text":"Heh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_24","text":"You really think I'd choose being a \"pro maid\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_25","text":"over my pride as a pirate?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_26","text":"You'd get a nice pay bump.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_27","text":"I'll think it over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_28","text":"Hehehehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"velvet_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_29","text":"A professional maid, huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"velvet_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_30","text":"Can I be one too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"cocoa","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_31","text":"Of course,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cocoa","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_32","text":"I'll teach you myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_33","text":"Me too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_34","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_35","text":"No, wait!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_36","text":"Oh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_37","text":"I didn't mean that! I don't even kno","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_38","text":"If Trony's going for it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_39","text":"I can't let her beat me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_40","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_41","text":"Then I, too, shall accept the challenge!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_42","text":"T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_43","text":"Heh,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_44","text":"I guess we won't be short on hands from now on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_fatalmaid_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_fatalmaid_04_45","tex